{"4689060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pollo Diavolo", "steam_appid": 4689060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4946510], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Lord of Terror has been reborn... in a bloody chicken</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689060/extras/250aa8229a84ab9a076904cac7ac0176.poster.avif?t=1785549242\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689060/extras/250aa8229a84ab9a076904cac7ac0176.webm?t=1785549242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4689060/extras/250aa8229a84ab9a076904cac7ac0176.mp4?t=1785549242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Pollo Diavolo</strong> is a fast-paced action roguelite with weapon-driven builds and procedurally generated dungeons packed with hordes that want you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are what you wield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every weapon has its own skill tree, primary ability, and special attack. Swap weapons mid-run, stack synergies, and forge a build that's entirely yours — there is no single correct answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every run makes you stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death resets your build, but gold and key resources persist, fueli